## groups for mqttgroupuser, in the shape Active Directory returns in memberOf:
## full DNs, a group name that is a prefix of another (GROUP-X and GROUP-X-ADMIN),
## a mixed-case name, and OU paths of different depth.
## mqttgroupuser is a member of every group below except GROUP-X.
